<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Fire Sphere</h1>
<p>The spells of the fire sphere burn: the sorcerers' bolts and storms of flame, the dark knights' hellfire and brimstone, and the burning rays of the sun. Your ability in the sphere decides how well you cast them, and also how well you resist fire spells cast on you (see <a cmd='#'>Help Spheres</a>). To resist fire better, see <a cmd='#'>Help Heat Resistance</a>; dragons may also breathe fire (see <a cmd='#'>Help Breath</a>). Sun beam and solar flare can't be cast at present, because of a known bug.
</p><p>The spells, and who teaches them (guild level):
</p>
<pre>sun ray       healer 31, druid 41
fire breath   no guild teaches it
sun beam      no guild teaches it
solar flare   no guild teaches it
burn          sorcerer 0
fireball      sorcerer 14
firestorm     sorcerer 28
fire blast    sorcerer 150
lava flow     dark knight 11
hellfire      dark knight 32
brimstone     dark knight 80
soulfire      dark knight 100
</pre>
<p>Each spell has its own help: help and the spell's name.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Spheres</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Heat Resistance</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Sorcerer Spells</a>
</pre>




</div>